    "question_text": "Which symbol goes between 2/3 and 1/4?",
    "correct_answer": ">",
    "hint": "Think about which fraction is closer to a whole.",
    "worked_solution_steps": [
      "Step 1: Find a common denominator. 3 × 4 = 12.",
      "Step 2: Convert 2/3 = 8/12 and 1/4 = 3/12.",
      "Step 3: Compare: 8/12 is greater than 3/12.",
      "Step 4: So 2/3 > 1/4. ✅"
    ],
    "analogy": "Imagine two pizzas. 2/3 of a pizza is more than 1/4 of a pizza."
